<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<section xml:id="context" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>The Context of Our Program</title>

  <p>
    We developed these dimensions within the context of UCI Math CEO, an after-school math program
    focused on LatinX youth in middle school, run on a university campus, and with undergraduate
    students serving as mentors who run activities with the students. Students usually work in
    small groups of 6<ndash/>8 students and 2 mentors. The program leadership developed the content
    of each activity and trained mentors beforehand, in person, on how to run the activities, the
    goal of each activity, and general teaching practices. The training includes virtual homeworks,
    as well as weekly reflection about the pedagogical practices.
  </p>
</section>
